<title>GERMANY: Veba says Q1 net profit up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Veba says Q1 net profit up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>Group net profit after minority</p>
<p>    interests				    486     vs 454</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,079   vs 1,010</p>
<p>    Group income taxes			 483     vs 469</p>
<p>Group net profit before minority</p>
<p>    interests				    596     vs 541</p>
<p>    Group sales				  19,624  vs 18,211</p>
<p>    --of which petrol tax		    1,574   vs 1,539</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified energy and telecommunications group is Veba AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
